        "original_id": "3142836d-9e67-51d6-8c3f-e13c262d1273",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"The Hand That Feeds\", \"Closer\", \"Hurt\"\n- People: Mark Romanek, Johnny Cash, Madonna, Michael Jackson, Janet Jackson\n- Organizations: Nine Inch Nails, Red Hot Chili Peppers\n- Products: Billboard Hot 100, pop radio, \"The Downward Spiral\"\n\nFacts:\n- \"Closer\" is a song by Nine Inch Nails from the band’s 1994 second studio album \"The Downward Spiral\".\n- Nine Inch Nails had top 40 radio hits with \"Closer\" in 1994 and \"Hurt\" in 1995.\n- Mark Romanek directed notable music videos including Nine Inch Nails’ \"Closer\", Johnny Cash’s \"Hurt\", Red Hot Chili Peppers’ \"Can’t Stop\", Madonna’s \"Bedtime Story\", and Michael and Janet Jackson’s \"Scream\".\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" crossed over to pop radio as Nine Inch Nails’ first top 40 radio hit since \"Closer\" and \"Hurt\".\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" peaked at number 31 on the Billboard Hot 100 chart.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
